# Database And Migration Rules

- Never edit old Flyway migrations already in history.
- Add new migrations with clear forward-only intent.
- Keep entity and repository updates aligned with migration changes.
- Preserve compatibility for production profile DB settings in `application.yml`.

# Validation

- Run tests that touch persistence.
- Run package build to ensure JPA metamodel generation remains healthy.
